    {
      "sort_order": 1,
      "title_en": "The Tea Party",
      "body_en": "Nong Fah invited Ollie to a tea party.\n\n\"If we are going to have a tea party,\" said Ollie, \"we must use polite words.\"\n\nNong Fah arranged the tea set. When Ollie arrived she said, \"Hello, Ollie. How are you today?\"\n\n\"I am very well, thank you,\" said Ollie.\n\n\"Please come in and have a seat. There is a place next to Miss Bunny.\" Miss Bunny is a toy rabbit. She did not answer, because she is very shy.\n\nNong Fah brought a plate of cookies. \"Would you like a cookie, Ollie?\" \"Yes, please,\" said Ollie. \"Thank you.\"\n\nThen Nong Fah poured the tea. The cup slipped and fell into Ollie's lap. \"I am so sorry!\" said Nong Fah.\n\n\"That is quite all right,\" said Ollie kindly. \"Could you please pass me a napkin?\""
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 2,
      "title_en": "Nong Fah's Day",
      "body_en": "Nong Fah woke up at six o'clock in the morning. The sun was shining through her curtains.\n\nShe washed, put on her school clothes, and ate her breakfast. At half past seven it was time for school.\n\nShe arrived at school at eight o'clock, just as the bell rang.\n\nAt half past eleven the teacher said, \"It is lunchtime.\" Nong Fah ate rice and vegetables.\n\nAt twelve o'clock it was noon. After lunch she played with her friends until one o'clock.\n\nSchool finished at four o'clock. She walked home.\n\nThe family ate dinner at half past five in the evening.\n\nAt eight o'clock at night, Nong Fah brushed her teeth and went to bed."
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 3,
      "title_en": "My Five Senses",
      "body_en": "Ollie taught Nong Fah about the five senses.\n\n\"You use your eyes to see,\" he said. Nong Fah looked at a red flower.\n\n\"You use your ears to hear.\" Nong Fah listened to a bird singing in the tree.\n\n\"You use your nose to smell.\" Nong Fah smelled the flower. It was sweet.\n\n\"You use your tongue to taste.\" Nong Fah tasted a slice of orange. It was sour!\n\n\"And you use your hands to touch.\" Nong Fah touched a smooth stone and a rough rock.\n\n\"Five senses!\" said Nong Fah. \"Now I know them all.\""
    }
  ],
